The chemical space is Cu–W–O after an 800 °C reaction, so the principal candidate is copper tungstate, with CuO/WO₃ polymorphs or related copper tungstates as plausible residuals. I’m now extracting peak positions and checking the installed phase-identification/database tooling before committing to a model.

